		level: "A2",
		chapter: "travel",
		genre: "travel",
		theme: "overnight sleeper train across Slovakia",
		topic: "Matej travels across the country on the night sleeper train from Košice to Bratislava",
		recap: "Matej boards the night sleeper train Zemplín in Košice, falling asleep to the rhythmic clatter of tracks and waking up in Bratislava.",
		cast: [{ name: "Matej", gender: "m", age: "young" }],
		sentences: [
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Nočné cestovanie vlakom má v sebe neopísateľnú poetiku a pokoj.", en: "Night train travel possesses an indescribable poetry and peace within itself." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "V nedeľu o desiatej večer som stál na osvetlenom nástupišti železničnej stanice v Košiciach.", en: "On Sunday at ten in the evening I stood on the lit platform of the railway station in Košice." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Čakal som na nočný rýchlik Zemplín, ktorý premáva naprieč celým Slovenskom až do hlavného mesta.", en: "I was waiting for the night express Zemplín that runs across all of Slovakia all the way to the capital." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Kúpil som si lístok do lôžkového vozňa, aby som sa počas šesťhodinovej cesty pohodlne vyspal.", en: "I bought a ticket into the sleeper car so that I would sleep comfortably during the six-hour journey." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Pri dverách modrého vozňa ma privítal stevard v elegantnej uniforme a skontroloval môj cestovný lístok.", en: "At the door of the blue car the steward in elegant uniform welcomed me and checked my travel ticket." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Moje kupé bolo čisté, útulné a voňalo vyžehlenou bielizňou.", en: "My compartment was clean, cozy and smelled of ironed bed linen." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Na pohodlnom lôžku už bol pripravený mäkký vankúš, teplá prikrývka a fľaša minerálnej vody.", en: "On the comfortable berth a soft pillow, warm blanket and a bottle of mineral water were already prepared." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Zložil som si ruksak pod posteľ, prezliekol sa do pohodlného domáceho trička a zhasol veľké svetlo.", en: "I stowed my backpack under the bed, changed into a comfortable casual t-shirt and switched off the main light." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Vlak sa s jemným trhnutím pohol a stanica sa pomaly vzdialila v tme.", en: "The train moved with a gentle tug and the station slowly receded into the dark." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Nechal som roletu na okne mierne pootvorenú a pozoroval som nočnú krajinu.", en: "I left the window blind slightly open and watched the nighttime countryside." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "V tme blikali svetielka spiacich dedín, tiché siluety lesov a opustené staničné lampy.", en: "In the dark lights of sleeping villages, quiet silhouettes of forests and deserted station lamps blinked." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Monotónny a rytmický zvuk kolies na koľajniciach pôsobil ako najlepšia uspávanka.", en: "The monotonous and rhythmic sound of wheels on rails acted like the best lullaby." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Uložil som sa pod perinu a zaspal som hlbokým, nerušeným spánkom.", en: "I tucked myself under the duvet and fell into a deep undisturbed sleep." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Ráno o pol šiestej ma zobudilo tiché zaklopanie stevarda na dvere kupé.", en: "In the morning at half past five the steward's quiet knock on the compartment door woke me." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Stevard mi priniesol rannú kávu a čerstvý maslový croissant v papierovom vrecúšku.", en: "The steward brought me morning coffee and a fresh butter croissant in a paper bag." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Vytiahol som roletu a za oknom svitalo nad rovinami Žitného ostrova.", en: "I pulled up the blind and outside dawn was breaking over the plains of Žitný ostrov." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Ranná hmla sa vznášala nad poliami a obloha bola zafarbená do jemných pastelových tónov.", en: "Morning mist hovered over the fields and the sky was tinted in gentle pastel tones." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Vlak práve spomaľoval pred vjazdom na bratislavskú Hlavnú stanicu.", en: "The train was just slowing down before entering Bratislava Main Station." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Vystúpil som oddýchnutý a plný energie pripravený na nový pracovný týždeň v hlavnom meste.", en: "I stepped out rested and full of energy ready for a new work week in the capital." },
			{ who: "Matej", sk: "Nočný vlak je nielen ekologický, ale aj najpríjemnejší spôsob, ako prekonať celú krajinu.", en: "The night train is not only ecological, but also the most pleasant way to cross the entire country." },
		],
