		title: "Slovenská svadba",
		level: "A2",
		chapter: "family",
		genre: "diary",
		theme: "traditional wedding celebration",
		topic: "Zuzana attends her cousin's joyous traditional wedding in Orava with midnight čepčenie",
		recap: "Zuzana attends her cousin Veronika's village wedding in Orava, experiencing folk costumes, accordion music and midnight bridal cap ceremony.",
		cast: [{ name: "Zuzana", gender: "f", age: "young" }],
		sentences: [
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Uplynulú sobotu som zažila najkrajšiu udalosť tohto roka – svadbu mojej sesternice Veroniky.", en: "Past Saturday I experienced the most beautiful event of this year – my cousin Veronika's wedding." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Svadba sa konala v malebnej dedinke pod Roháčmi v rázovitom regióne Orava.", en: "The wedding was held in a picturesque village beneath Roháče in the distinctive Orava region." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Obrad sa uskutočnil v starobylom drevenom kostolíku so zvonicou.", en: "The ceremony took place in an ancient wooden church with a belfry." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Keď nevesta vošla do uličky v bielych čipkovaných šatách, viacerým hosťom vyhŕkli slzy dojatí.", en: "When the bride walked into the aisle in white lace dress, tears of emotion welled up for several guests." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Po výmene manželských sľubov a zlatých prsteňov sme novomanželov zasypali ryžou a kvetmi pre šťastie.", en: "After the exchange of marriage vows and gold rings we showered the newlyweds with rice and flowers for luck." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Svadobná hostina sa konala vo veľkom vyzdobenom kultúrnom dome plnom svetiel.", en: "The wedding reception was held in a large decorated community hall full of lights." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Pri vchode privítali mladomanželov tradičným rozbitím taniera a ženích musel črepy pozametať.", en: "At the entrance they welcomed the newlyweds with the traditional breaking of a plate and the groom had to sweep the shards." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Podľa tradície to symbolizuje, že manželia budú spoločne riešiť všetky starosti v živote.", en: "According to tradition this symbolizes that the spouses will resolve all troubles in life together." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Jedlo bolo bohaté a slávnostné: domáca slepačia polievka, sviečková na smotane a desiatky druhov zákuskov.", en: "The food was lavish and festive: homemade chicken soup, marinated sirloin in cream sauce and dozens of pastry types." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Ľudová hudba s husľami, cimbalom a basou hrala rezko do tanca a parket bol neustále plný.", en: "Folk music with violins, dulcimer and bass played lively for dancing and the dance floor was constantly full." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Tancovali sme tradičný oravský kolesový tanec a všetci spievali známe ľudové piesne.", en: "We danced the traditional Orava round dance and everyone sang well-known folk songs." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Presne o polnoci nastal najdojímavejší zvyk celej slovenskej svadby – začepčenie nevesty.", en: "Precisely at midnight came the most moving custom of the whole Slovak wedding – capping the bride." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Miestne ženy v krojoch spievali clivé obradné piesne a zložili Veronike z hlavy biely svadobný závoj.", en: "Local women in folk costumes sang plaintive ceremonial songs and took the white bridal veil off Veronika's head." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Namiesto závoja jej založili vyšívaný ženský čepiec ako znak toho, že sa stala vydatou ženou.", en: "Instead of the veil they put an embroidered woman's bonnet on her as a sign that she became a married woman." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Nasledoval redový tanec, kde každý hosť tancoval s mladou nevestou a prispel jej do klobúka na spoločný život.", en: "The money dance followed, where every guest danced with the young bride and contributed to the hat for their shared life." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Zábava, smiech a tanec pokračovali až do skorých ranných hodín, kým nevyšlo slnko.", en: "Fun, laughter and dance continued until the early morning hours until the sun rose." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Každý hosť dostal pri odchode domov bohatú výslužku s koláčmi a fľašou domácej pálenky.", en: "Every guest received a generous parting box of cakes and a bottle of homemade spirits when leaving home." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Bola to nezabudnuteľná oslava lásky, rodiny a živých slovenských ľudových tradícií.", en: "It was an unforgettable celebration of love, family and living Slovak folk traditions." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Cítila som hlbokú hrdosť na naše dedičstvo a silu komunity, ktorá vie držať spolu.", en: "I felt deep pride in our heritage and the strength of the community that knows how to stick together." },
			{ who: "Zuzana", sk: "Veronike a jej manželovi želám zo srdca dlhý, pokojný a láskou naplnený spoločný život.", en: "To Veronika and her husband I wish from my heart a long, peaceful and love-filled shared life." },
		],
